woocommerce	connection	wp_options		high	0	The copy keeps the live site's Jetpack connection; connected services would act for the live site, and WooCommerce Shipping, Tax or Payments are active	Disconnect the copy: delete the blog token in jetpack_private_options and the auth entry in woocommerce_helper_data, or define JETPACK_STAGING_MODE in its wp-config.php	act as the live site	The copy keeps the live site's Jetpack connection; connected services would act for the live site, and WooCommerce Shipping, Tax or Payments are active
woocommerce	email	wp_options		high	2	2 WooCommerce Memberships emails are enabled; staging would send them to members, for example when a membership ends	Turn these emails off in WooCommerce > Settings > Emails in the copy, or route mail to a catcher such as Mailpit	email members	2 WooCommerce Memberships emails are enabled
woocommerce	email	wp_options	woocommerce_new_order_settings	medium	0	WooCommerce emails store staff about new and cancelled orders; staging would email them too	Set these emails to off in WooCommerce > Settings > Emails in the copy, or route mail to a catcher such as Mailpit	email store staff	WooCommerce emails store staff about new and cancelled orders
woocommerce	payments	wp_actionscheduler_actions	woocommerce_scheduled_subscription_payment	critical	6	6 subscription renewal payments are scheduled; staging would try to charge customers when they fall due	Cancel these actions in the copy, or make sure WooCommerce Subscriptions starts in staging mode	charge customers	6 subscription renewal payments are scheduled
woocommerce	payments	wp_options	woocommerce_stripe_settings	high	0	Payment gateway "stripe" is enabled in live mode	Switch the gateway to test or sandbox mode and remove the live keys in the copy	take live payments	Payment gateway "stripe" is enabled in live mode
woocommerce	scheduled_jobs	wp_actionscheduler_actions		medium	40	40 pending scheduled actions would run on staging (most common: woocommerce_cleanup_draft_orders (20), wc-admin_import_orders (14), woocommerce_scheduled_subscription_payment (6))	Cancel pending actions in the copy, or turn off WP-Cron and Action Scheduler there	run scheduled actions	40 pending scheduled actions would run on staging
woocommerce	webhooks	wp_wc_webhooks		high	2	2 active webhooks would send order and customer data from staging to their delivery URLs	Set status to 'disabled' (or delete the rows) in the copy	post to webhooks	2 active webhooks would send order and customer data from staging to their delivery URLs
wordpress	backups	wp_options	updraft_service	high	0	UpdraftPlus backups are scheduled and go to Amazon S3; staging would send its backups there too	Remove the remote storage in UpdraftPlus's settings in the copy, or turn its backup schedule off	upload backups	UpdraftPlus backups are scheduled and go to Amazon S3
wordpress	email	wp_options		medium	1	1 plugin setting sends notification emails to staff addresses (for example fixture_admin_recipient)	Point these settings at a test address, or route mail to a catcher such as Mailpit, in the copy	email staff	1 plugin setting sends notification emails to staff addresses (for example fixture_admin_recipient)
wordpress	email	wp_options	wp_mail_smtp	high	0	Outgoing email is sent through WP Mail SMTP (mailer: sendgrid)	Point the mailer at a mail catcher such as Mailpit, or turn it off, in the copy	send email	Outgoing email is sent through WP Mail SMTP (mailer: sendgrid)
wordpress	email	wp_postmeta	_mail	medium	1	1 Contact Form 7 form emails its submissions to the addresses in its settings	Route mail to a catcher such as Mailpit in the copy, or add demo_mode: on to each form's Additional Settings	email form recipients	1 Contact Form 7 form emails its submissions to the addresses in its settings
wordpress	scheduled_jobs	wp_options	cron	medium	5	5 WP-Cron events would run on staging, including UpdraftPlus backups, WPForms email summaries, WooCommerce usage tracking and Ultimate Member jobs (most common: um_daily_scheduled_events (1), updraft_backup (1), woocommerce_tracker_send_event (1))	Turn cron off on the copy's host (DISABLE_WP_CRON stops runs on page loads, not a system cron), and change the plugins' own settings, since they schedule their events again	run cron events	5 WP-Cron events would run on staging, including UpdraftPlus backups, WPForms email summaries, WooCommerce usage tracking and Ultimate Member jobs
